1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,440
Abhi bhi haath se type kar rahe ho? To ye suno.

2
00:00:02,440 --> 00:00:06,680
Wispr Flow ke 15 dollar nahi bharne? Aaja, tereko open source alternative batata hoon.

3
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,760
To is repository ka naam hai Handy.

4
00:00:08,760 --> 00:00:12,720
Handy ek aisa open source tool hai, jo completely Wispr Flow ki tarah hai.

5
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:14,560
But iski ek bahut badi khaasiyat hai.

6
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:16,640
Ye poori tarah se aapke laptop pe chalta hai.

7
00:00:16,640 --> 00:00:19,880
Koi API credit nahi. Kisi ko bhi aapka data nahi jaa raha.

8
00:00:19,880 --> 00:00:22,080
Completely sirf aur sirf aapke laptop pe.

9
00:00:22,080 --> 00:00:26,520
Is mein milti aapko complete privacy aur Wispr Flow ke level ki voice typing.

10
00:00:26,520 --> 00:00:31,200
Ise setup karna bahut aasaan hai, iski GitHub repo pe chale jao, ise install kar lo.

11
00:00:31,200 --> 00:00:34,960
Aur phir bas kuch hi steps ke baad aapka Handy bilkul ready to use ho jaayega.

12
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:38,040
Iska poora installation guide chahiye? Comment kar do "Guide".

13
00:00:38,040 --> 00:00:41,680
Iski poori repository aur installation guide aapke DMs mein aa jaayega.
